# Workflow canvas

## Ownership

| Concern | Module |
|---|---|
| Graph state (spaces, nodes, edges) | `lib/store.ts` → `useWorkflowStore` |
| Input resolution / topo / waves | `lib/executor.ts` |
| Pipeline run orchestration | `lib/usePipelineRunner.ts` |
| Node registry (picker, sizes, seed settings) | `lib/nodeTypes.tsx` |
| Canvas shell + `nodeTypes` map | `components/WorkflowCanvas.tsx` |
| Persist to SQLite | `lib/useSpaceSync.ts` + `requestWorkflowSync()` |

## Node types (canonical)

`promptNode` · `imageInputNode` · `videoInputNode` · `generateNode` · `videoGeneratorNode` · `assistantNode` · `commentNode` · `groupNode`

- Register new types in **all** of: `nodeTypes` map, `NODES` / `NODE_META` / `NODE_SIZE`, and `getNodeLabel` in the store.
- Generation nodes that participate in pipelines: `generateNode` | `videoGeneratorNode` only.

## Patterns

- Nodes are `"use client"`; read/write via `useWorkflowStore` + `updateNodeData(id, partial)`.
- Resolve upstream inputs with `resolveInputs(nodeId, nodes, edges)` — honour handle-specific frames (`startFrameOut` / `endFrameOut` / `imagePickOut`).
- Durable media field: `r2Url` (local `/generated/...`). Session-only: `inputImage` (data URL). Prefer `r2Url` when present.
- Status: `idle` | `pending` | `running` | `done` | `error`. Pipeline uses `pendingGenerate` / `pipelineQueued`.
- Discrete edits (add/delete/connect/resize-end): call `requestWorkflowSync()`. Continuous (drag/type): rely on debounce — do not spam sync.

## UI on nodes

- Use `.node-card` / `.node-header` / shared classes from `app/globals.css` and helpers (`GenerateButton`, `NodeActionBar`, `CornerResizer`, `MissingInputWarning`).
- Accent colors come from `NODE_META` in `lib/nodeTypes.tsx`.
